# Cloudflare Pages redirects - fantasystakesapp.com
#
# NOTHING HERE TAKES EFFECT UNTIL A CUSTOM DOMAIN IS ATTACHED. On the
# *.pages.dev preview hostname the www rule simply never matches, which is why
# it is safe to commit ahead of the cutover.
#
# WWW TO APEX. Both hostnames must be attached to the Pages project for this to
# fire; attaching only the apex leaves www unresolved at DNS and this line is
# never reached. The alternative - a Cloudflare Redirect Rule at the zone - is
# equally valid and is the better choice if www should redirect before it ever
# reaches Pages. Pick one; running both is how a redirect loop gets built.
#
# THE DEMO IS NOT REDIRECTED FROM HERE. The demo lives on the application at
# app.fantasystakesapp.com and is reached through the configured link in
# site/js/config.js. A /demo redirect on the marketing host would be a second
# place to change the destination, which is the exact thing that configuration
# file exists to prevent.
